## How the slice was produced

From a build of commit `aaaabbbb` made with `tools/cts/mali-deqp-build.sh`:

```
BOARD_HOST=<board> tools/cts/mali-deqp-run.sh --build <build-dir> --out tools/cts/log/clean --rows 1-2 --tree tools/cts/mali-gles2-tree.txt --session smoke
```

`BOARD_HOST` comes from the lease on `target:nanopc-t6`. The slice holds no host name, address, user name or serial; the raw dEQP logs stay out of git.
